From: Adam Bateman <abateman121@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:20:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] v0.0.14: intro/outro detection and ad tagging

Per-show audio fingerprint templates find the intro and outro in every
episode, with chapters and the old fixed seconds as fallbacks. New Set
intro/outro tool, Re-detect action, and /api/episodes/{id}/markers.

New Tag ad tool for missed ads. Tagged ads are skipped at once and are
learned by audio fingerprint and by transcript phrase. Not an ad marks
wrong skips.

Adds numpy and scipy, SKIP_CONFIDENCE and AD_AUDIO_CONFIDENCE settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
